{"id":"acghqb1b0z4r64drmoq8bprwi","title":"Hugging Face 发布 Transformers 模型集成合同标准及配套工具","originalTitle":"Transformers Model Integration Contracts","summary":"Hugging Face 发布新工具mic cli及标准，用于检测模型集成中的回归问题。通过缩小模型构建测试合同，该标准能检测如UMT5解码器未来令牌关注导致的bug。测试方法包括生成文本（示例：'法国的首都是'→'Paris'）、检查训练损失、梯度有限性验证等，并提供了CLI工具自动化流程。当前标准已覆盖部分模型，未来计划完善覆盖范围。","reason":"原文提供了测试标准的具体实现路径和工具链，读者可据此评估模型兼容性测试的可行性","source":{"name":"Hugging Face Blog"},"links":{"original":"https://huggingface.co/blog/transformers-mic"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-03T00:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-03T07:57:48.737Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-03T07:57:48.737Z","category":"paper","tags":["论文/研究","开源/仓库","安全/对齐"],"score":81,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"e7e62baa-ebb7-49ef-905b-37a9d01cfa02","title":"Hugging Face发布模型集成合同标准及工具"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"e7e62baa-ebb7-49ef-905b-37a9d01cfa02","title":"Hugging Face发布模型集成合同标准及工具"}],"topics":[{"slug":"open-source","name":"开源生态"},{"slug":"safety","name":"安全对齐"},{"slug":"papers","name":"论文研究"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fvPz1m3q3ycM","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}